        "content": "<p>You can't prove anything about <code>Float</code> but in this case, you don't need to. <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Nat.mod_lt#doc\">docs#Nat.mod_lt</a> should be able to reduce this to something provable, try: <code>Nat.mod_lt (Nat.zero_lt_of_lt a.current.property)</code></p>",
